## API reference

### ReviewSummary

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `rating:` | `Numeric` | - | Required. The average score. |
| `reviews:` | `Integer` | - | Number of reviews, shown pluralized under the stars. |
| `max:` | `Integer` | `5` | Stars in the scale (and breakdown rows). |
| `verified:` | `Boolean` | `true` | Say "verified reviews". |
| `label:` | `String` | translated | Replace the review-count line. |

### Parts

| Part | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `ReviewBreakdown(counts:, href:)` | One row per star: the star, a Meter, the share in %. |
| `ReviewHighlight(avatars:) { text }` | A separator, an AvatarGroup of `{ src:, alt: }` and a line of text. |

## Accessibility

- The stars are one labelled image ("4.8 out of 5"); each breakdown meter is labelled "5 star reviews".
- Linked rows are regular links with the star, the meter and the percentage as their content.
